    {
      "id": "regroup-by-place-value",
      "title": "Add by place value",
      "explanation": "Each decimal column contains the digits \\(1,2,3,4\\) exactly once, so every column has digit sum \\(1+2+3+4=10\\).\n\nAdding the contributions from the thousands, hundreds, tens, and ones places gives\n\\[\n1234+2341+3412+4123\n=10(1000+100+10+1)\n=10\\cdot1111\n=\\boxed{11{,}110}.\n\\]\nThe answer is choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{E}}\\).",
      "directNodeIds": [
